ailable agent tool before writing your PUBLIC_MESSAGE.\" So we could ask about crew cooperation for D? Our notes: D is regarded as a know-it-all and has a hot temper. That suggests potential crew cooperation issues. So we have some info. We could bring that up.\n\nThus, we can respond: I agree B is strong, but we need to consider crew cooperation. Candidate D shows strong responsibility and problem solving, but his hot temper and know-it-all attitude raise concerns. Compare with B's pretentiousness. Which is more severe? I think B's communication style may be mitigated, while D's hot temper could be more dangerous. So I still support B.\n\nThus our contribution: I agree with B but highlight crew cooperation concerns and compare with D. Provide evidence: D takes responsibility seriously, solves problems extremely well, but has hot temper and know-it-all. B is conscientious, handles stress, but pretentious. I argue B remains best.\n\nThus vote remains Candidate B.\n\nWrite public message accordingly."}
